`timescale 1ns/1ps
// tb_icm_xor_and_or.v — AUTO-GENERATED by icm_stream.py.
// Replays the 'xor_and_or' ICM stream (SET_TARGET,CMD_LOAD_AT pairs) against the
// real unicell RTL through the target-latch transport, then checks each cell's
